{
 "_doc": "Tier-3 bank on Larch Street (Pell's Crossing, lot 'bank', the third block; front faces the street). A brick branch with a flat roof behind a parapet. Route: front doors bolted from inside -> round the west side to the break-room window (smashed; the line came in this way) -> the back hall (loose boards in front of the vault wake the tellers behind the counter) -> Ruth Calloway's office: her ledger and the vault combination in her desk (taking it wakes the line in the lobby) -> the loan office -> the lobby -> behind the teller line -> the back hall again: the vault door (a battery alarm still armed on some runs; cutting it instead screams through the building, ADR-0026) -> the vault (loot; Sgt. Vance, the guardian) -> out through the lobby: unbolt the front doors. Side loot: the safe-deposit room behind a shotgun wire. See docs/POI_AUTHORING.md.",
